08:05:54.733 > 2258.148038 s  ch33  x207   yy yy 01 00 80  ID yyyy  mode 01  group none  wake held  span 272.6 ms  gap 537-7351 us
08:05:54.834 > 2258.424353 s  ch33  x70    yy yy 01 00 00  ID yyyy  mode 01  group none  wake release  span 71.1 ms  gap 482-3748 us
08:05:55.309 > 2258.577565 s  ch33  x351   yy yy 01 00 80  ID yyyy  mode 01  group none  wake held  span 393.4 ms  gap 551-5669 us
08:06:13.272 > 2276.322955 s  ch33  x597   yy yy 30 08 80  ID yyyy  mode 30  group 4  wake held  span 611.1 ms  gap 533-4434 us
08:06:26.837 > Sniff stopped. 1923 packets.

