#
# IR picks the shade, so with no shade seeing the IR nothing was removed:
# afterwards `grp 4 up` with this remote's ID still moved the shade.
# (The firmware then printed "wake held/release" for action 80/00; it now
# prints "pair remove held/release" for mode 31.)

