## 4. Clone pairs under its own ID (no remote involved)
#
# Firmware `pair <group> <add|remove>`: setup frames ID 30|31 GROUP 80 on
# ch 33, IR (OPEN for add, CLOSE for remove), ch 52, IR, ch 71, IR, about
# 0.66 s in all (seq timings: RF 50 ms per channel, IR 170 ms per step).
# Made-up ID C1 0E, group-4 shade:
#   grp 4 up before pairing ............ no response
#   pair 4 add, a few inches from eye .. shade jogged
#   grp 4 up / down after pairing ...... 5/5 up, 5/5 down
#   pair 4 remove ...................... not tested yet (C1 0E is still paired)
